  "definition": "Deemed Interest",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-08-12",
  "historyNote": "#4557, eff 12-28-88; ss by #5947, eff 12-29-94; ss by #6321, eff 8-22-96; ss by #8137, eff 8-10-04; ss by #10211, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13443, eff 8-12-22",
